	(text "CARRIER HEADERS: J102 = carrier J2, J103 = carrier J3 (2.54 mm pin strips,\nsoldered through both boards; the strips are in the carrier BOM)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "30e741f6-d5d0-50da-a049-c60bd9f612fc")
	)
	(text "BOOT/RESET buttons and the SWD header are on the carrier (B side).\nHold BOOT, press RESET: ROM bootloader on the USB-C (wchisp / WCHISPTool)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 86.36 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "618db7b2-dc89-573f-bf06-19072c586d11")
	)
	(text "PCM3168A TDM (codec ADC = clock master, BCK 12.288 MHz). I2S2 slave RX: PB13 CK, PB12 WS, PB15 SD <- DOUT1.\nI2S3 slave TX: PB3 CK, PA15 WS, PB5 SD -> DIN1. SPI1 slave (96 kHz only): PA5 SCK, PA4 NSS = LRCK,\nPA7 MOSI <- DOUT2, PA6 MISO -> DIN2. I2C2: PB10/PB11 (codec 0x44). PB14 codec RST."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "74dd37e8-4fae-527f-8162-013c5ad8b1e5")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR USB-AUDIO-MAX - MCU board, S2. CH32V307RCT6, USB 2.0 High-Speed (UAC2, up to 96 kHz / 24-bit, 6 in / 8 out). Circuit intent: docs/research.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b8f538b8-527b-5fbe-a402-cbf83026fdbb")
	)
	(text "USB-C (vertical, through the panel): data only, VBUS sensed on PA9 (no power drawn).\nD+/D- -> USBLC6-2SC6 -> PB7/PB6 = USBHS_DP/DM (also the ROM bootloader port)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 129.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e13d2237-498a-5d4d-a0dc-7bc2a39322a3")
	)
